rce src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659800/extras/9c3a156b9cc84705943556e0ccc6a692.mp4?t=1753886214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empowered by this ancient gift, you\u2019ll feel the urge to <strong>explore every corner of this world</strong>, moving freely to uncover souls to collect, hidden areas, and secrets that will help you understand the mysterious environment around you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659800/extras/5d2c673b43352b4e90c4ea29795003f1.avif?t=1753886214\" width=616 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659800/extras/2535897310ed4b56c1fc63740a706891.poster.avif?t=1753886214\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659800/extras/2535897310ed4b56c1fc63740a706891.webm?t=1753886214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659800/extras/2535897310ed4b56c1fc63740a706891.mp4?t=1753886214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple yet layered</strong>, engage in swift, fluid combat where enemies require different strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use clever tactics, attack from below in your shadow form, slam foes against walls, or crush the ground nearby to stun and break their defenses. Adapt your moves and turn the tide of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659800/extras/a4a7ec2125e3d482e8adfd3e2b326f7b.avif?t=1753886214\" width=616 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659800/extras/81ce194eb10a6f5e4cfc224ba8b67974.poster.avif?t=1753886214\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659800/extras/81ce194eb10a6f5e4cfc224ba8b67974.webm?t=1753886214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659800/extras/81ce194eb10a6f5e4cfc224ba8b67974.mp4?t=1753886214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and enhance abilities that grant passage through <strong>paths once sealed</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Return to familiar lands with new powers to uncover hidden routes, discover collectibles, and gain abilities that help you advance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to step into the shadows of Inumbra?</p>",
